msgstr "![Ieșirea celulei de cod anterioare](/learning/images/courses/quantum-diagonalization-algorithms/vqe/extracted-outputs/4a1cdcf3-7d94-4a1f-b675-9549bf28d956-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
