# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum has other upskilling offerings related to VQE. If you are ready to put VQE into practice, see our tutorial: [Ground-state energy estimation of the Heisenberg chain with VQE](/tutorials/spin-chain-vqe). If you want more information on creating molecular Hamiltonians, see [this lesson](/learning/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe/hamiltonian-construction) in our course on [Quantum chemistry with VQE](/learning/courses/quantum-chem-with-vqe). If you are interested in a deeper understanding of how variational algorithms like VQE work, we recommend the course [Variational Algorithm Design](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/optimization-loops).\n"
